cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the AI Runtime Evidence Protocol (AIREP), please cite it as below."
title: "AI Runtime Evidence Protocol (AIREP)"
abstract: >-
  A neutral, vendor- and model-independent record format for per-decision AI runtime
  governance evidence: one signed, tamper-evident, chained record per AI decision, checkable
  offline by an independent verifier. AIREP is a proposed open format with one reference
  implementation; it is not a ratified standard. v0.1 is the stable, recommended
  implementation target; v0.2.0-alpha.1 is an experimental prerelease that does not supersede
  it and has no producer implementation.
